From e4c761772bd928bdde171fd8984b6fb57abfe9a3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 23:46:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] feat(research-focus): mirror the research-stack comms
 lens

research-stack added a 12th focus tag, comms (voice, SMS and dialers), between
data-infra and legal. RESEARCH_FOCUS_MAP now mirrors it: pathways data and
security, the privacy-evidence overlay, addendum "Telephony and messaging plan".
The tag-count check moves to 12, and a distinctive security pathway now also
derives comms (security, ai-agents, comms). The design reference lists the 12
tags and the new derivations.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LWfLzbXaVEAGYrKt39r4bc
---
 references/pathway-operating-layer.md | 8 +++++++-
 scripts/operating-layer.py            | 2 ++
 scripts/tests/operating_layer_test.py | 6 +++---
 3 files changed, 12 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

